# ALLOWLIST. This working directory will hold things that must never be
# published: the ROM input, extracted/derived game assets, rendered frame
# dumps, recordings, package builds and reference clones (refs/).
# Only source, scripts and docs are tracked -- everything else is ignored by
# the leading "*" and has to be re-included explicitly below.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.mp4
*.log
*.core
!dev.sh
!docker/
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/Dockerfile.oot
!docker/Dockerfile.oot
# The port tree: z2442/oot-PSP @ 8f04fa0 (zeldaret/oot decomp + PSP port layer), imported
# without its ROM-derived recipe metadata (assets/psp/ntsc-1.0), IDO binaries and icon.
# port/.gitignore keeps build/, extracted/, baseroms/ ROMs out.
!port/
!port/**
port/build/
port/extracted/
port/expected/
port/.venv/
port/baseroms/*/baserom*
port/**/__pycache__/
port/tools/ido5.3_compiler
port/tools/ido7.1_compiler
# The Miyoo Mini release (notes/miyoo.md, README_MIYOO.md): the packer, its templates and game.json,
# the release script. The zips stay local (a PERSONAL one holds the player's ROM).
!README_MIYOO.md
!miyoo/
!miyoo/game.json
!miyoo/tools/
!miyoo/tools/miyoo_pack.py
!miyoo/templates/
!miyoo/templates/app_config.json
!miyoo/templates/forward.sh
!miyoo/templates/launch.sh
!tools/
!tools/build_miyoo.sh
!tools/pack_miyoo_personal.sh
*.zip
!miyoo/icon.png
!miyoo/icon.svg
# frame / texture dumps are ROM-derived images
port/**/*.ppm
# the Miyoo64 repository's docs
!SETTINGS.md
